/T (Race & Ethnicity - Respondent data shows that 69% of Charlotte music census participants identify as White/European Origin and 16% as Black/African American. An additional 5% identify as Two or More Races, 7% as Hispanic, 2% as Asian or Asian American, 0% as Native American or Alaska Native, and 1% who preferred not to say. Compared to the Charlotte general population, the census reflects higher representation among White/European Origin respondents and lower representation among Black/African American and Hispanic respondents.)
/E (Race & Ethnicity - Respondent data shows that 69% of Charlotte music census participants identify as White/European Origin and 16% as Black/African American. An additional 5% identify as Two or More Races, 7% as Hispanic, 2% as Asian or Asian American, 0% as Native American or Alaska Native, and 1% who preferred not to say. Compared to the Charlotte general population, the census reflects higher representation among White/European Origin respondents and lower representation among Black/African American and Hispanic respondents.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
