/T (Venue/Presenter Type -  Venue and Presenter respondents represent a wide range of operating models. Live music venues make up the largest share of respondents \(29%\), followed by performing arts centers and theaters \(18%\) and independent promoters \(10%\). Additional respondents include community spaces \(8%\), festivals \(8%\), event spaces for rent \(6%\), pop-up or temporary venues \(6%\), and smaller shares of bars, coffee shops, house or DIY venues, and hybrid performance spaces \(each 2%\). This mix points to a decentralized and flexible live music ecosystem.)
