/P 1970 0 R
/T (Venue/Presenter Business Resources - Venue/Presenter respondents emphasized practical tools to support sustainability and audience growth. Audience development tools, including local media, gig calendars, and publicity support, were prioritized by a large majority of respondents \(85%\). Best practices for presenting live music locally \(72%\) and opportunities for venue or presenter coalitions, such as a local NIVA-style chapter \(57%\), were also commonly cited. Social media groups for local presenters \(54%\) and directories of local production providers \(50%\) further point to demand for peer learning, shared resources, and coordinated infrastructure.)
/E (Venue/Presenter Business Resources - Venue/Presenter respondents emphasized practical tools to support sustainability and audience growth. Audience development tools, including local media, gig calendars, and publicity support, were prioritized by a large majority of respondents \(85%\). Best practices for presenting live music locally \(72%\) and opportunities for venue or presenter coalitions, such as a local NIVA-style chapter \(57%\), were also commonly cited. Social media groups for local presenters \(54%\) and directories of local production providers \(50%\) further point to demand for peer learning, shared resources, and coordinated infrastructure.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
