/T (Information Sources for Music Opportunities - Respondents most commonly learn about music-related opportunities through social media platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok \(71%\), followed closely by word of mouth and personal networks \(66%\). Direct requests from venues, producers, or event organizers \(30%\) and information shared by local music or arts organizations \(23%\) play a secondary role. Traditional outlets such as venue calendars and local media were cited less frequently, suggesting opportunities to improve coordination and visibility across existing information channels.)
