/T (Familiarity with Local Music Organizations and Initiatives - Levels of familiarity with local music organizations vary widely among Charlotte respondents. For most organizations included in the survey, fewer than one in five respondents report being very familiar, while a much larger share indicate they are only somewhat familiar or not familiar at all. This pattern suggests that while Charlotte has an active landscape of music-related organizations and initiatives, awareness and visibility remain uneven across the broader music ecosystem.)
