/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 432 0 R
/T (Venues/Presenters in Charlotte face a range of regulatory challenges, with sound policy ranked as the most pressing issue \(21% greatest impact\), followed by confusion and inefficiency \(19%\), special event specifics \(12%\), and inspections \(11%\). The cost of permits \(8%\) also contributes to operational strain for live music presenters. Respondents express strong interest in tools that make navigating city processes simpler and more transparent, led by an online permitting and communication portal \(87%\), followed by a webpage of current live music regulations \(70%\), an advocate within local government \(65%\), and a single point of contact for permitting \(65%\).)
/E (Venues/Presenters in Charlotte face a range of regulatory challenges, with sound policy ranked as the most pressing issue \(21% greatest impact\), followed by confusion and inefficiency \(19%\), special event specifics \(12%\), and inspections \(11%\). The cost of permits \(8%\) also contributes to operational strain for live music presenters. Respondents express strong interest in tools that make navigating city processes simpler and more transparent, led by an online permitting and communication portal \(87%\), followed by a webpage of current live music regulations \(70%\), an advocate within local government \(65%\), and a single point of contact for permitting \(65%\).)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [5]
>>
