/T (Regulatory Challenges - Venues and Presenters report sound policy as their top regulatory challenge, with 21% ranking it as having the greatest impact, followed closely by confusion and inefficiency \(19% greatest\). Special event specifics \(12% greatest\) and inspections \(11% greatest\) represent additional pressure points, while the cost of permits \(8% greatest\) further adds to administrative burden. Together, these results highlight persistent challenges related to regulatory clarity, consistency, and implementation that affect the day-to-day viability of presenting live music in Charlotte.)
